Version: 1.0
ProjectId: 0d7cfe15-5c2f-4759-98d2-c1fe5863e702

RestoreWorkspace: No
SaveWorkspace: No
AlwaysSaveHistory: No

EnableCodeIndexing: Yes
UseSpacesForTab: Yes
NumSpacesForTab: 2
Encoding: UTF-8

RnwWeave: Sweave
LaTeX: pdfLaTeX

BuildType: Package
PackageUseDevtools: Yes
PackageInstallArgs: --no-multiarch --with-keep.source -Wtabs
PackageRoxygenize: vignette

QuitChildProcessesOnExit: Yes
DisableExecuteRprofile: Yes
